# RenderEngine dataset licenses

The datasets under `data/` are redistributed under the following permissive
licenses. Each external dataset also carries a LICENSE file beside its own
directory (enforced per-dataset by the T2 gate).

| Dataset | Source | License |
|---|---|---|
| `data/meshes/bunny.obj` (Stanford bunny) | Stanford 3D Scanning Repository, via alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models | Public domain (Stanford Computer Graphics Laboratory scan data) |
| `data/meshes/teapot.obj` (Utah teapot) | Martin Newell, via alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models | Public domain |
| `data/volumes/sample_ct.nrrd` (CT chest) | Slicer Testing Data (Medical Decathlon `CT-chest.nrrd`) | CC-BY-SA 4.0 |

See `data/README.md` (finalized in T2) for the authoritative source URLs and
SHA256 checksums (SPEC section 7).
